            "review_title": "Review at Kyoto Oh! Sushi Bar Japanese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Ania Z\nMoscow, Russia68 contributions\n0\nThe best sushi and rolls of my life\nApr 2026 • Couples\nJapanese restaurant Oh! Sushi Bar is located in the north of Nha Trang. Exact address: 1 Đ. Bắc Sơn, Vĩnh Hải, Bắc Nha Trang. It's better to take a taxi from downtown. By the way, we had to come here twice. The first time we arrived was on Monday and the restaurant was closed, as were many places in Nha Trang. So pay attention and check the hours and days of operation. \nThe restaurant left me with only the most positive impressions. An interesting type of boarding is separate booths with Japanese-style locking doors. To place an order you need to go to the restaurant app, there you choose the payment type – card or cash. Orders come quickly, all dishes at once, drinks a little earlier. The prices are above average, but I swear it's worth it. These are the best sushi and rolls we've ever had. The fish in the sushi melts in the mouth, the rice hardly feels. There is nothing too much in the rolls - no fat sauces, just fresh fish, melting rice in your mouth and some vegetables. I love rolls and honestly I just can't imagine how they are now in Moscow after what I tasted in this restaurant. And the main thing is that after them, there is not the slightest sense of gravity or mad thirst that covers me after the rolls in Moscow.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten April 25, 2026\nOh! Sushi Bar Nha Trang\nThank you!\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
